      "text": "Git\ngit checkout main\n* main\ngit branch -b <feature/fix/.../refactor>/<description>-<description...>\n* ...\ngit push -u origin HEAD #local to cloud",
      "fontSize": 19.95245088856062,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Git\ngit checkout main\n* main\ngit branch -b <feature/fix/.../refactor>/<description>-<description...>\n* ...\ngit push -u origin HEAD #local to cloud",
