      "text": "- Happy Path (code as intended)\n- guard clauses (if not None: ...)\n- helper functions\n    - if used atleast 3 times, def _abstract_out() -> None:\n- Balance type safety with code speed, readability\n    \"\"\" this includes doc strings\n            <args>:\n            <returns>:\n        See source code as examples,\n        https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/v2.13.0/torch/accelerator/__init__.py#L102\n    \"\"\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Happy Path (code as intended)\n- guard clauses (if not None: ...)\n- helper functions\n    - if used atleast 3 times, def _abstract_out() -> None:\n- Balance type safety with code speed, readability\n    \"\"\" this includes doc strings\n            <args>:\n            <returns>:\n        See source code as examples,\n        https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/v2.13.0/torch/accelerator/__init__.py#L102\n    \"\"\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2n"
