      "updated": 1784739801119,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Timeblocking\n    - 5: read design\n    - 5: pseudo code\n    - 20: implement happy path\n    - 10: edge cases, testing, documentation, robustness (typesaftey)\n-> make it work -> make it right -> make it fast\nKeep things clean and modular, high cohesion and low coupling",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Timeblocking\n    - 5: read design\n    - 5: pseudo code\n    - 20: implement happy path\n    - 10: edge cases, testing, documentation, robustness (typesaftey)\n-> make it work -> make it right -> make it fast\nKeep things clean and modular, high cohesion and low coupling",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2p"
