      "updated": 1784739770311,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If I had to start my software engineering career again in today's job market...\n\nI'd learn these 10 things in this order:\n\n1. Data Structures & Algorithms\n2. Backend Development\n3. System Design\n4. SQL & Database Design\n5. Cloud (AWS/GCP)\n6. Docker & Kubernetes\n7. AI Development (LLMs, RAG, Agents)\n8. CI/CD & DevOps\n9. Debugging & Production Engineering\n10. Communication & Writing\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If I had to start my software engineering career again in today's job market...\n\nI'd learn these 10 things in this order:\n\n1. Data Structures & Algorithms\n2. Backend Development\n3. System Design\n4. SQL & Database Design\n5. Cloud (AWS/GCP)\n6. Docker & Kubernetes\n7. AI Development (LLMs, RAG, Agents)\n8. CI/CD & DevOps\n9. Debugging & Production Engineering\n10. Communication & Writing\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3I"
    },
